      "source": [
        "# Project: Breast Cancer (SEER) & FUTURE-AI\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook prepares the data **identically for all groups**, so results stay comparable even if you choose different FUTURE-AI criteria. It contains:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. Dataset import\n",
        "2. Label creation (5-year Overall Survival)\n",
        "3. Train/test split and Cross-Validation\n",
        "4. Data pre-processing\n",
        "\n",
        "**From here on, the project is yours.** You will need to add:\n",
        "- **EDA** — explore the dataset: distributions, subgroups, any data quality issues, relationships between variables and with the outcome\n",
        "- **Machine Learning pipeline** — feature engineering/selection, model choice and comparison, hyperparameter tuning (using the Cross-Validation already set up), final evaluation on the test set\n",
        "- **FUTURE-AI assessment** — Fairness, Universality, Traceability, Usability, Robustness, Explainability and design a concrete analysis for each\n",
        "\n",
        "**Important rule**: the test set created in this notebook must be used **only for the final evaluation** of the chosen model. To compare models/hyperparameters during development, use Cross-Validation on the train set — never the test set, otherwise the final results will be optimistically biased (\"procedural\" data leakage).\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
